    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "We all need to spend time alone once in a while. But Beatriz Flamini took things to a whole new "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The Spanish "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "extreme athlete",
            "ref": "v-extreme-athlete"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " decided to take on a huge challenge: She spent 500 days alone in a 70-metre-deep cave, completely cut off from the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Flamini "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the dark cave on November 20, 2021. To keep herself "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", she took with her 60 books and some art "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "supplies",
            "ref": "v-supplies"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for drawing. She also carried two cameras to take a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of her daily life and activities underground. A team of supportive volunteers helped her by "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " dropping off necessary food, water and clean clothes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "During her long "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", Flamini said that she completely lost her sense of time after about two months. So, she was very "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " when the volunteers finally came down to get her on April 14, 2023. “"
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "?” she asked in disbelief. “No way! I hadn’t even "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " reading all my books.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "With this "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "feat",
            "zh": "壮举"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", Flamini set a new world record for the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b11",
            "number": 11
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " time living in a cave alone. But her main goal was not just to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b12",
            "number": 12
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the record. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b13",
            "number": 13
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", she wanted to test her own "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "willpower",
            "ref": "v-willpower"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and mental limits. More importantly, she did this for scientific research. She wanted to help scientists learn more about how long-term "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b14",
            "number": 14
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "isolation",
            "ref": "v-isolation"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " affect the human body and mind. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b15",
            "number": 15
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", Flamini!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
